{"name":"Pink Pilates Princess","title":"Pink Pilates Princess","revision":217777,"url":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Pink_Pilates_Princess","retrieved":"2026-09-06","license":"CC BY-SA","licenseUrl":"https://www.fandom.com/licensing","language":"en","blocks":[{"kind":"heading","text":"History"},{"kind":"paragraph","text":"The roots of this aesthetic are said to lie in 2000s fashion. The arrival of Frankie's Bikinis: Pilates Princess collection, launched this niche aesthetic into the fame. The inspirations behind the collection was clear as it has been described to “infuse ballet fashion with trendy athleisure to create functional and feminine apparel for your everyday lifestyle–whether you’re working out, running errands, or lounging around.” ( This collection included a variety of pastel pink pieces, workout gear and racerback dresses.."},{"kind":"heading","text":"Style"},{"kind":"list","text":"Plush oversized pullovers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Uggs"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leggings"},{"kind":"list","text":"Pink+white athleisure"},{"kind":"list","text":"Silver jewellery"},{"kind":"list","text":"Leg warmers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Sneakers (white, especially dad sneakers)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Silk pink pyjama sets"},{"kind":"list","text":"Duffel bags (usually pink)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Water bottles (usually pink)"},{"kind":"heading","text":"Activities"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watching Vogue Beauty secrets videos"},{"kind":"list","text":"Meditating"},{"kind":"list","text":"Working out (especially Pilates and barre workouts)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading self-help books"},{"kind":"list","text":"Making/drinking matcha, smoothies, cucumber/lemon water, or iced coffee"},{"kind":"list","text":"Listening to Lana Del Rey and other ‘girly” artists"},{"kind":"list","text":"Skincare"},{"kind":"list","text":"Watching beauty influencers"},{"kind":"list","text":"Reading in general (especially with a face mask on)"},{"kind":"list","text":"Shopping"}],"contentStatus":"full-source","images":[{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/4/48/Pink-pilates-princess.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20221120120459","caption":"Pink-pilates-princess","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Pink-pilates-princess.jpg","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0772-1.webp","localAvailable":true},{"src":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/aesthetics/images/2/23/Screen_Shot_2022-11-20_at_10.18.47_AM.png/revision/latest?cb=20221120153105","caption":"Pink Pilates Princess · Visual reference 02","source":"https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/File:Screen_Shot_2022-11-20_at_10.18.47_AM.png","remote":true,"local":"images/detail/0772-2.webp","localAvailable":true}]}